rain
title Transitive authority through a group
doc-team: (Doc)-[edit(Doc)]->(Team) : Doc grants Team Edit
(Team)-[admin(Team)]->(Alice)       : Alice joins Team
(Alice)-[edit(Doc)]->(Bob)          : derived route: through Team
(Bob)=[[edit]]=>(Doc)
(Bob)-[read(Doc)]->(Alice)          : leftward, powered from below
(Doc)-<revoke>-x[doc-team]          : the root revokes; everything downstream is void
